<title>BAHRAIN: ABC says 96 net up at $129 mln.</title>
<headline>ABC says 96 net up at $129 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arab Banking Corp, one of largest banks in the Arab world, said on Wednesday its 1996 net profit rose to $129 million from $116 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The Bahrain-based bank said pre-tax profit reached $177 million, up 19 percent from $149 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
